theory of step 3.a
React se jo JSON data form ke zariye aayega, DRF use seedha request.data mein pack kar deta hai.
serializer.is_valid(): Yeh check karta hai ki database ke rules follow hue ya nahi (jaise title blank toh nahi hai). Agar sab theek hai, toh serializer.save() database mein nayi row insert kar deta hai.



